{"id":"2e9513e51e","t":"A Wicked Husband","c":"cv","n":54,"l":54,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"a-wicked-husband"},"u":1795038774358,"desc":"حين عاد الأرشيدوق سيزار من الحرب، بالكاد استطاعت إيلين أن تتعرّف إلى الرجل الذي عرفته يومًا… صار باردًا، آمِرًا، تتأجّج في عينيه رغبة مكتومة. ولكن ما زلزل كيانها حقًا كان عرضه المفاجئ للزواج. وبينما تتصاعد في قلبها مشاعر قديمة، تجد إيلين نفسها أمام مفترقٍ مصيري: هل تمسك بيده، أم تهرب قبل أن يلتهمها لهيب شغفه؟","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["تاريخى","جوسى","دراما","رومانسى","فنتازيا","مانهوا"],"src":{"ml":"a-wicked-husband"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"a-wicked-husband|/manga/a-wicked-husband/1/"},"2":{"ml":"a-wicked-husband|/manga/a-wicked-husband/2/"},"3":{"ml":"a-wicked-husband|/manga/a-wicked-husband/3/"},"4":{"ml":"a-wicked-husband|/manga/a-wicked-husband/4/"},"5":{"ml":"a-wicked-husband|/manga/a-wicked-husband/5/"},"6":{"ml":"a-wicked-husband|/manga/a-wicked-husband/6/"},"7":{"ml":"a-wicked-husband|/manga/a-wicked-husband/7/"},"8":{"ml":"a-wicked-husband|/manga/a-wicked-husband/8/"},"9":{"ml":"a-wicked-husband|/manga/a-wicked-husband/9/"},"10":{"ml":"a-wicked-husband|/manga/a-wicked-husband/10/"},"11":{"ml":"a-wicked-husband|/manga/a-wicked-husband/11/"},"12":{"ml":"a-wicked-husband|/manga/a-wicked-husband/12/"},"13":{"ml":"a-wicked-husband|/manga/a-wicked-husband/13/"},"14":{"ml":"a-wicked-husband|/manga/a-wicked-husband/14/"},"15":{"ml":"a-wicked-husband|/manga/a-wicked-husband/15/"},"16":{"ml":"a-wicked-husband|/manga/a-wicked-husband/16/"},"17":{"ml":"a-wicked-husband|/manga/a-wicked-husband/17/"},"18":{"ml":"a-wicked-husband|/manga/a-wicked-husband/18/"},"19":{"ml":"a-wicked-husband|/manga/a-wicked-husband/19/"},"20":{"ml":"a-wicked-husband|/manga/a-wicked-husband/20/"},"21":{"ml":"a-wicked-husband|/manga/a-wicked-husband/21/"},"22":{"ml":"a-wicked-husband|/manga/a-wicked-husband/22/"},"23":{"ml":"a-wicked-husband|/manga/a-wicked-husband/23/"},"24":{"ml":"a-wicked-husband|/manga/a-wicked-husband/24/"},"25":{"ml":"a-wicked-